# ── Local audit / verification scripts ──────────────────────────────────────
# One-off helpers written at the repository root while auditing. They are not
# part of the application, they reference absolute local paths, and
# backend/server.js already returns 404 for them at runtime. Keep them out of
# git without deleting them.
verify.js
verify_dom.js
final_check.js
check_*.js
audit_*.js
*_audit.js

# Generated test fixtures (uploads used to exercise the CV endpoints)
backend/test-*.pdf
backend/uploads/
backend/temp/
backend/tmp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig

# Render's deploy config is intentionally COMMITTED - it is required for the
# Blueprint and contains no secret values (secrets are declared sync:false).
# Listed here only as a guard against a broad future pattern swallowing it.
!render.yaml
